# Jira descriptions and comments (CHR / fe-anysphere-demo)

When writing Jira issue descriptions, comments, or automation output for project **CHR** or **fe-anysphere-demo**:

- Use **GitHub-flavored Markdown**: `##` headings, `**bold**`, `-` lists, `[text](url)` links, fenced code blocks.
- **Do not** use Confluence wiki markup (`h2.`, `{code}`, `{noformat}`, etc.) — Jira Cloud shows it as plain text.
